## STEP 6 — SCREEN 4: Tasks

Tasks live as a sub-panel **on the Shots screen**, not a separate page. They appear below the shot table when a shot row is selected.

### 6a — Queries (add these to the Shots page)

---

**Query: `get_tasks`**
- Run: When `selected_shot` changes (add trigger: `selected_shot`)
- SQL:
```sql
SELECT
  t.id,
  t.task_type,
  t.description,
  t.sequence_order,
  t.global_default_cost,
  t.project_default_cost,
  t.task_cost_override,
  t.estimated_cost,
  t.actual_cost,
  t.flow_task_id,
  -- Show which tier is active
  CASE
    WHEN t.task_cost_override IS NOT NULL THEN 'override'
    WHEN t.project_default_cost IS NOT NULL THEN 'project'
    ELSE 'global'
  END AS cost_source
FROM tasks t
WHERE t.shot_id = {{ selected_shot.id }}
ORDER BY t.sequence_order, t.task_type;
```

---

**Query: `get_task_defaults`**
- Run: On page load
- SQL:
```sql
SELECT
  tcd.task_type AS value,
  tcd.label,
  COALESCE(ptd.default_cost, tcd.default_cost) AS default_cost,
  tcd.default_cost AS global_cost,
  ptd.default_cost AS project_cost,
  tcd.label || ' ($' || COALESCE(ptd.default_cost, tcd.default_cost)::text || ')' AS display_label
FROM task_cost_defaults tcd
LEFT JOIN project_task_defaults ptd
  ON ptd.task_type = tcd.task_type
  AND ptd.project_id = {{ selected_project.id }}
ORDER BY tcd.label;
```

---

**Query: `create_task`**
- Run: Only when triggered
- SQL:
```sql
WITH defaults AS (
  SELECT
    COALESCE(ptd.default_cost, tcd.default_cost) AS project_default,
    tcd.default_cost AS global_default
  FROM task_cost_defaults tcd
  LEFT JOIN project_task_defaults ptd
    ON ptd.task_type = tcd.task_type
    AND ptd.project_id = {{ selected_project.id }}
  WHERE tcd.task_type = {{ sel_task_type.value }}
)
INSERT INTO tasks (
  shot_id, task_type, description, sequence_order,
  global_default_cost, project_default_cost, task_cost_override
)
SELECT
  {{ selected_shot.id }},
  {{ sel_task_type.value }},
  {{ txt_task_description.value }},
  (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(sequence_order), 0) + 1 FROM tasks WHERE shot_id = {{ selected_shot.id }}),
  global_default,
  project_default,
  NULLIF({{ num_task_cost_override.value }}, 0)
FROM defaults
RETURNING id;
```
- On success: run `get_tasks`, run `get_shots` (to refresh estimated_cost total)

