| Problem | Fix |
|---|---|
| `get_shots` returns no rows | Check `selected_project.id` is set — navigate from Projects first |
| Tags column shows `[object Object]` | Confirm custom column expression uses `.join(', ')` not direct render |
| Cost trigger not firing | Verify the `sync_shot_tags` trigger was created — check Supabase → Database → Triggers |
| Episode filter shows for feature projects | Add visibility condition on `sel_episode_filter`: `{{ selected_project.project_type === 'series' }}` |
